{"title":"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> be the two real values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> for which\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/f/6bfa6cfbd124d39ce17e94863e3118eb3a717a7e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sqrt[3]{x} + \\sqrt[3]{20 - x} = 2\\]\" width=\"146\" height=\"19\" />\nThe smaller of the two values can be expressed as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/0/b10277d6c0e75d9e39a2a3eb4f9c6e68d25a9889.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p - \\sqrt{q}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"56\" height=\"18\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/1/0615acc3725de21025457e7d6f7694dab8e2f758.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> are integers. Compute <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/6/856ee48ce76ddbd106a05384c2ea2c28e3b76c02.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p + q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"41\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/2/23255cb23e02fce7f68777d1d536080fa5285400.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=\\sqrt[3]{x}, b = \\sqrt[3]{20-x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"167\" height=\"19\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/e/61e53a941e47755c43eb3612f9a5a5fcd86b0abf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"75\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/d/88d41a2ab622de6ff0435c32c948a8a116d2b3cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^3 + b^3 = 20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"96\" height=\"16\" />. Factoring, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/c/bfc02dae639fdffb1c3b860963e89499c4a0d169.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a^3 + b^3 = (a+b)((a+b)^2-3ab) = 2(4-3ab)= 8-6ab=20 \\Longrightarrow ab = -2\\]\" width=\"541\" height=\"19\" /> \n</p><p>Solving <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/a/a5ab2e2331f8dcbd51142e040f1d5f3d44325ea1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b=2, ab=-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"148\" height=\"18\" /> gives us the quadratic <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/7/d37806044bcba1971e36f60a9f70a14715c46ccc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2 - 2a - 2 = 0$\" width=\"122\" height=\"15\" />. The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Quadratic_formula\" title=\"Quadratic formula\">quadratic formula</a> yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/7/f07e97bded0f4a685cf53ca13429a212dd2e1e4b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = \\frac{2 - \\sqrt{12}}{2} = 1 - \\sqrt{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"182\" height=\"41\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/f/b7fec88ea28584b904bcb77ee5c47326f7b920c6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = a^3 = (1-\\sqrt{3})^3 = 1 - 3\\sqrt{3} + 9 - 3\\sqrt{3} = 10 - \\sqrt{108}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"436\" height=\"21\" />. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/0/a10acafba1bb9993650628525b21fcf8f9cbb057.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p+q=\\boxed{118}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"105\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005\">Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems\">Problems</a></b>, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/viewtopic.php?t=14769\">Source</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\